  "notes": "Surface derived 2026-07-28 from whatwg/html PR #11765 diff (commit 7aa3db5): a behavior change with no new web-facing API — the developer-facing contract is the dedup decision algorithm, the snapshot struct it compares against, the cookie carve-out state flag, and the observable effects. Spec PR is OPEN (verified 2026-07-28); Chrome 151 ships ahead of merged spec. Deliberately unspecified areas are preserved, not smoothed over: navigation.navigate() promise behavior for a dropped duplicate (proposal says reject; PR has no steps), no WPT files upstream yet (Chromium content browser tests only, CL 5856811), and both vendor positions are no-signal. Independent integrator review remains required before the sufficient claim is accepted."
